    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 358,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "[Simon]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 359,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "Ah, you must be a skilled"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 360,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "practitioner of magic. Mmm,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 361,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "you must one of those Wizards."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 362,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "High Wizards? I can't really"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 363,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "tell the difference. Ah, may"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 364,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "I be of service to you?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 366,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "I'm fine, thank you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 366,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "I want to learn about push backs."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 367,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "[Simon]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 368,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "I'm surprised that you chose"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 369,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "to practice magic: judging"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 370,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "from your build, I'd say that"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 371,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "you'd be well suited to wielding a sword. Haha, but that's just"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 372,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "a humble Knight's opinion."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 375,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "[Simon]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 376,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "Wait, are you asking me"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 377,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "to teach you a Push-Back"
