    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 378,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "attack technique? You can"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 379,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "defend yourself using spells"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 380,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "like Fire Wall or Fire Bolt"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 381,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "much more effectively, right?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 383,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "But at close range..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 384,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "[Simon]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 385,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "Oh, I see. Yeah, Wizards"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 386,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "aren't very effective in close"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 387,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "range battles. Okay, I can see"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 388,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "why you'd want to learn some"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 389,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "Push-Back technique. Alright,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 390,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "I can teach you a few basics."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 392,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "[Simon]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 393,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "Now, every adventurer knows"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 394,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "the fundamentals of attacking."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 395,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "You strike, and then ready your"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 396,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "next action, which is either"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 397,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "another strike, a dodge or a"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 398,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "guard. Simple stuff, right?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 400,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "[Simon]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 401,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "To push an enemy back, you've"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 402,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "got to attack using a strike"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 403,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "with continuous force. It's all"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 404,
      "npc" : "Simon Mayace",
      "text" : "in the follow through. Now, if"
    },
